    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73849" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμο-τᾰγής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ranged in the same row</i>
			or <i>line,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Euc.
				12.12
			</span></i> ; of lines of vision, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄψεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					<u>UP</u>
					10.12
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Dioptr.</u>
				35
			</span></i> ; <i>parallel,</i> of streets, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				9.20.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>coordinate with,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				4.144d
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
				<u>in EN</u>
				59.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Comm.Math.</u>
				14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				21
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				108
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				37
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-γῶς</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				119
			</span></i>.</div>
